{"server":"cn","storyId":"act14side_level_act14side_08_end","groupId":"act14side","stageId":"act14side_08","title":"将军","storyCode":"BI-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"de7261eeeb4d4ecc19808b05efa47b99e9a2f141ad0d9ef224715fcb42967d8d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是萨尔贡宫廷的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"......上一份工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到你能认出萨尔贡的剑术。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对法术不感兴趣，但是和兵器有关的东西，想忘都难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪黑骑士被称作天生的武者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，从“不会使用法术的莱塔尼亚残次品”，到“天生的武者”需要花费多长的时间？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你没有痛觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你在童年的时候，每天除了睡眠就是忍受痛楚，你也会习惯这种感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你有多少次与死亡擦肩而过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"在战争中，我所知道的有心思去数的人都活不长久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，黑骑士因为不愿意与商业联合会合作，以三届冠军之身，遭到流放与追杀，最终消失在卡西米尔边境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经不畏强权的象征，如今却以阴谋家的保镖身份，参与篡夺一个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我不做道德评判，但我也觉得有些遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，你们罗德岛应该理解恩希欧迪斯的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"理解是理解，接受是另一码事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，我认为博士是理解恩希欧迪斯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不打算替恩希欧迪斯和自己辩解什么，太麻烦了，也没那个必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用你的双眼亲自去确认他到底想干什么吧——如果你活过今天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"几经艰险，恩希亚终于爬到了悬崖边，下一秒她就可以攀登上去，就在这时，不远处传来的交谈声，让她停住了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，山下乱成一锅粥，山上也乱成一锅粥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，大长老居然就那么倒下了，下面阿克托斯又带人杀上来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来以为接下来已经不会有大事发生了，这下我完全不知道事情会变成什么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是一开始就没觉得这下就安生了，只是，事情变成现在这样，感觉有点难过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从我们进驻蔓珠院以来，大小姐，呸，圣女大人明显掌握了主动权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大长老倒下后，现在整个蔓珠院已经完全听圣女大人的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而山下，恩希欧迪斯老爷也在掌控全局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么一说，还真是。山上，是圣女大人，山下，是恩希欧迪斯老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用你的话说就是，这下我完全不知道事情会变成什么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们做下人的，想这些也没什么用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，想这些又有什么用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再转两圈吧，说不定等一会儿我们也要被喊下山了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士C","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士D","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"粮仓着火了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士C","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！快去救火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，轻轻松松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是休露丝夫人，真是有您风格的做法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没，我这是夸您呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，事成之后我再出钱给他们重建一座粮仓就是了，现在事急从权！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别磨磨蹭蹭的了，趁着他们被火灾转移了注意力，关押尤卡坦的地方就在前面了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雅儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，圣女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大典的时候，我记得我在人群中偶然看到你时，你的身边还有一个戴着兜帽的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从其他人口中听说，这个人似乎就是恩希欧迪斯请来的罗德岛贵客，人们都叫他博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同时，也是现在站在阿克托斯那边，与恩希欧迪斯对抗的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞒不过圣女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么认识他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下山帮您送信时，偶然认识的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就当是这么一回事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎么忽然提起这个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想见一见他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道是出于什么理由，但他旗帜鲜明地站在了恩希欧迪斯的对立面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要知道他的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经不再怀疑自己想要做什么，但我害怕我决定得有些太晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要争取一些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这一点......您倒是不必担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他的使者已经在您背后了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚......看来我终于出现幻觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，姐姐，我不是幻觉，我真的是你的妹妹恩希亚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！恩希亚，真的是你吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我呀，姐姐，不信你摸摸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩雅想要用颤抖着的双手去触碰眼前的恩希亚。\n她生怕忽然出现的妹妹是虚假的。\n而不等她的手碰到恩希亚，恩希亚已经一头扎进了她的怀里。\n她立刻确认了，怀中的人，确实是自己最亲爱的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是你，恩希亚。真的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我好想你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很想你，恩希亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在外面过得还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的病怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫罗德岛的地方是个怎样的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，姐姐，你这些问题不都在信上问过了嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听我说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Sharp倒退了几步，微微吐了一口气。\n他生涯之中遭遇过许多对手，罗德岛上的诸多强者他也切磋过，或者至少观察过。\n他必须承认，自己没有见过锏这样的对手，或者说，锏这样纯粹的对手。\n速度与力量，每个战士都应当具备的素质。\n锏没有除此以外的东西，但她显然也不需要除此以外的东西。\n当一个人拥有凌驾于绝大多数人的力量与速度时，他为什么还需要别的东西？\n所幸......Sharp能够成为精英干员，也是因为这两样东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你很信任恩希欧迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有人为了钱能够做到这一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，本来就不是能用钱说动的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？嘴上说着只是为了工作，但你做的事已经超过了工作的范畴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我会确保我做的工作是我喜欢的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不喜欢卡西米尔，那里太嘈杂，人也太聒噪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为我也不会喜欢谢拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，谢拉格不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"这个理由不错，一个好的退休生活地点是非常重要的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不约而同地，双方都各退了几步。\n他们意识到了，要解决对手的话，刚才的进攻是没有用的。\n他们必须拿出更多的本领。\n锏将剑随手丢在一边，从腰间抽出了她的双锏。\nSharp也卸下手中的盾丢在一边，双手握住了手中的刀。\n苍翠的树上，一根树枝不堪积雪的重压，“啪”的一声断裂。\n同一时间，Sharp和锏也消失在了他们上一秒所处的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呀，真是让我不知道说你什么好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然是绕过所有人，从山脚下一路攀登上来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿，只有这样才能见到姐姐嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才说，是一个叫博士的人让你来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他让你来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士说，我应该待在姐姐你的身边，在必要的时候保护你，或者带你逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必要的时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士说，老哥他可能会对姐姐你做不好的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老哥他有自己的想法，我拦不住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是如果老哥的想法最后会伤害到你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我拼了命也会阻止他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩雅忽然明白了那个博士为什么要将妹妹送到自己的身边。\n保护、逃跑——这两个理由是说给妹妹听的。\n那个博士知道自己的想法，他也知道，自己见到妹妹这个行为本身，就会产生出意义。\n让恩希亚来保护她？\n让恩希亚带她逃跑？\n不，恰恰相反。\n她才是那个应该保护恩希亚的人。\n她才是那个应该带着恩希亚逃跑的人。\n她才是那个——应当战斗的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚，我过去给你编的手绳，你还戴着呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然戴着，我还会一直戴下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽空，我编一条新的给你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，恩希亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你愿意帮姐姐一个忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪着我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（外面很安静，但那两个看守应该还在。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（窗户......从这个角度要想不被发现，得先把外面的护卫引走。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（巡逻的路线......每天会有五次经过这附近，应该很快就要过来了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，不能强行破坏锁，但如果能撬开......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......应该还有机会。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的护卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......恩希欧迪斯大人......这次一定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——来了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的护卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三家......冲突看来免不了......但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的护卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......布朗陶家的......烧......休露丝夫人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（露丝......？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（露丝，露丝怎么了......？难道出了什么事？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可恶，还是太远了，听不清楚。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......不，一定没事的。我得先找办法离开这里，然后去找露丝和大夫人......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你们是什么人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快拦住他们——咕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（从门口传来的声音，发生了什么......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，你有没有事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露丝？！你怎么会在这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么会在这里？别说傻话了，当然是因为你在这啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人都靠不住，只有靠我来救你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这太危险了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露丝，你带了多少人来？你、你可以不用亲自过来的，我绝不想你因为我而冒险......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再多说一句，我就揍你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了！你可以为我冒多大的风险，那我对你，就也同样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了，不许忘记！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不许再把我一个人丢下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露丝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我不会这么做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我当然知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你没事我就放心了......现在嘛，我们还有点其他事情，我答应了菈塔托丝，在救到你之后还要顺便完成另一个任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休露丝夫人，希瓦艾什家的魏斯带人杀过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，这就来了。具体的等下慢慢给你说，总之，我们的任务就是给希瓦艾什找些麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......我还想去找个人，哎，这个之后再说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况算不上太好，那个魏斯不算好对付......但你会帮我的对吧，尤卡坦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。只要你有需要，我就会一直在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g6_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收紧包围圈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让阿克托斯冲上山道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩尔罗契家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，我们快要被包围了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，看来靠冲的只能冲到这里了吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯老爷，请投降吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶克家的小子，我不知道恩希欧迪斯给你灌了什么迷魂汤让你对他这么死心塌地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们耶克家，在我佩尔罗契领的名气也是响当当的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果你居然选择帮助恩希欧迪斯篡夺谢拉格！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"投降？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将阿克托斯老爷抓起来......尽量留活口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，希瓦艾什家的杂碎们，谁来和我一战？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......极光？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看来赶上了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"嗨。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"（拉了拉帽檐）","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你可算来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"忽然下雪，耽搁了一些工夫。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，谢拉格的雪对你这样的外乡人来说确实是个麻烦。"}]},{"label":"为了避开希瓦艾什家的耳目，花了一些时间。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你来得正是时候！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，既然援军也已经来了，这下已经没有什么能阻止我们了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，现在高兴是否还太早了些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，许久不见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"确实是“许久不见”。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"真的是“许久不见”吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你终于肯见我了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然有不少话题想要与你交流，不过很遗憾，现在并不是时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯，你就等着吧，我马上就会冲破你的包围圈，救出圣女，向全谢拉格证明，你才是那个叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拭目以待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战士们，我佩尔罗契家自古以来的职责是什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"“是守护谢拉格不受外敌侵犯，和保护这片土地的安宁！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，他恩希欧迪斯想要对圣女不利，想要把圣女作为自己的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们佩尔罗契家能答应吗！"},{"type":"narration","text":"“不能！不能！！绝不答应！！！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"援军已到，随我冲上圣山，打倒恩希欧迪斯，营救圣女！"},{"type":"narration","text":"“打倒恩希欧迪斯，营救圣女！”\n“打倒恩希欧迪斯，营救圣女！！”\n“打倒恩希欧迪斯，营救圣女！！！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人，您要干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要下山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯老爷说过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做事，什么时候需要恩希欧迪斯同意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“丁零”“丁零”“丁零——”\n空灵的铃声在寺院中回响。\n下一刻，除了恩希亚，所有在场的人全都倒在了地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......好厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿，雅儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人，您怎么知道我在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个丫头机灵得很，我就猜你在哪里躲着看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要下山一趟，这里就麻烦你帮我处理一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您要把这么麻烦的事情丢给我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为还有更麻烦的事在等着我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您这么说，那就没办法啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，每一次的圣女选拔，我都会扮成侍女，在暗中观察这一批接受试炼的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那一年的第六个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我没对你抱什么期望，因为最近的圣女变得越来越无聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们或许拥有坚韧的体魄，却没有足够强大的意志，最终只能成为长老团的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我时而也会觉得，是不是因为谢拉格太过封闭，使得她们，使得这个国家的人们，都变得停滞不前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很有意思，恩雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你不是为了成为圣女而来的，你是因为愤怒和失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你顶着风雪走在圣山的山道上，当你即使精疲力尽也不愿意放弃的时候，你脑中所想的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是成为圣女，不是成为耶拉冈德的代理人，不是为谢拉格人谋福祉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想的，是对你哥哥的失望，是对另外两大家族的厌恶，是你要成为圣女吓他们所有人一跳的愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更让我惊喜的，是你对谢拉格的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，实际上应该说是你们兄妹带给我的惊喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的哥哥很早就给出了一份答卷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，也一直在探索属于你自己的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年，你忍受住了圣女在蔓珠院所受的冷遇，主动寻找着各种帮助人民的方法，这些都成为了你的食粮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，这些食粮转化为了你的力量，你在这次动乱中没有迷失自己，你做出了你的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝贺你，我的孩子，我的代理人，我的朋友，我的姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原谅我无法为你指明道路。我曾经冒失地将这片土地打上我的烙印，直到现在，我都在后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少在此刻，让我为你的启程之路增添几分色彩吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寂静的过道上，雅儿面带笑容，轻轻拍了两下手。\n“啪”“啪”\n然后，一切都改变了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不痛不痒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦莱丝，或许阿克托斯老爷也有对不起你的地方——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但恩希欧迪斯他也不是什么好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格必须要改变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是为了让像你这样出色的战士不再白白牺牲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逼我，瓦莱丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话应该是我来说，古罗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人各退一步，摆好架势。\n他们知道，今天，恐怕必须要有一个人在这里倒下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌云......散了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，真是顽强，我小看你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，即使你们打败我也没有任何意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是无法阻止老爷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，夫人......菈塔托丝姐姐对谢拉格有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也想要人们往前走，希望能让人们过上好日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，她没有力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是，她成了你们口中那个诡计多端的菈塔托丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许在你们看来，姐姐只是一个绊脚石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我眼中，她永远是我最敬爱的姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对你们也没有个人恩怨，只要你们愿意放弃，我可以保证你们的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我不会让我和露丝成为恩希欧迪斯与大夫人谈判的筹码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希瓦艾什家的魏斯，闪开，不然，我会杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这句话应该是我来说，布朗陶家的尤卡坦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，你必须留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，加油啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣山那边，乌云怎么裂开了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"narration","text":"Sharp转身，看着缓缓将双锏收回腰间的锏。\n在他们身边，如同天灾短暂地扫过大地，断裂的树木，粉碎的岩石随处可见。\n他没有注意到自己的刀从手中滑落，因为，他的右手已经失去了知觉。\n他输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三个月内，最好不要过度使用你的右手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的忠告，看起来该请个短时间的病假了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来并不沮丧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战斗的输赢并不能改变任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我将你在这里拖到了现在，我的任务已经完成了，其余的人会完成剩下的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"工作结束了，我下班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作对你来说，有这么重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，保持职业精神非常重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"找到一个好的雇主并不容易，至少这份工作我很在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你从一开始就知道我是来拖延你的，而现在，你并不沮丧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有些好奇，即使你拦住我，你们能做到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，恩希欧迪斯的保镖并不像传闻中那样只为他扫平一切敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"人们只知道是恩希欧迪斯买下了黑骑士，却没想过，这同样也是黑骑士承认了恩希欧迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你和恩希欧迪斯同样骄傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会记住你的名字，Sharp。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可以不记住我，但你可以记住博士的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"圣山那边，发生了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战士们，列阵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩尔罗契家战士们","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全军——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家战士们","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"时间仿佛在这一刻静止。\n只有圣女的脚步声在山间回荡。\n风雪早已在不知何时停止。\n天上的乌云像是在为她开路一般，缓缓向两边散开。\n穿过乌云的光照在圣女行走的道路上，一时间，竟让人产生错觉，圣女正从天上走来。\n又或者说，这并非错觉。\n神迹......\n这是神迹。\n这是神迹！！！\n在这一刻，所有战士的心中都只有一个想法。\n那就是——向圣女献上他们最虔诚的信仰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍女","speakerId":"avg_npc_269","isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退下吧，我来照顾大长老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍女","speakerId":"avg_npc_269","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大长老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，正殿虽然经过了许多次修缮，但它的年纪，可能也没有比祂小多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大长老这个名头，也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大长老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会有人否认，是蔓珠院的存在才让谢拉格以团结的姿态存续到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，过去正确的事，现在未必正确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果无法适应时代，无论多么强大，也只有被抛弃的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格不应止步于此，至少，有人不这么希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做个好梦，大长老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了，辛苦你们了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦莱丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那难道是，神迹......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣山那边发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，收队。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生了......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......难道是耶拉冈德降下的神迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格......这下会变成什么样子呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真刺眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些好奇，这也在你那个博士的计划之内吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，如果这确实在博士的计划内，或者哪怕他至少预料到了这样的可能性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"就算干员们普遍喜欢宣称博士无所不能，但是这也太过夸张了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，恩希亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐会保护你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......会保护谢拉格。"},{"type":"narration","text":"山道上的所有士兵，在这一刻都放下了武器。\n自己毕生信仰的雪山之神已经显现了神迹，在祂面前，一切的斗争都显得那么可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......佩尔罗契家家主，阿克托斯·佩尔罗契，向祂的代理人，圣女大人，献上最诚挚的祝福。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"短暂的沉默后，他缓缓向圣女行了一个礼，而后，单膝跪下。\n在场所有佩尔罗契家的战士，也随着他的动作尽数跪下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩希欧迪斯，你现在，后悔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有听从我最初的意见，以及，将那个博士请来谢拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为我们输了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，在你的观念中，这就算输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在过去，确实是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在今天......未必。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩希欧迪斯迈动脚步。\n他缓缓走出人群，同样来到圣女的面前，单膝跪下，献上了自己的祝福。\n随后，希瓦艾什家的战士，也尽数跪下。\n雪山事变，以一种谁都没有预料到的方式，落下了帷幕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
